  "items": [
    {
      "id": "h1-vocab-used-to",
      "familyId": "h1-used-to",
      "skillIds": [
        "vocab.context"
      ],
      "level": "G0",
      "section": "vocabulary",
      "reviewMode": "recognition",
      "promptZh": "在句子中选择 used to 的正确含义。",
      "resourceId": null,
      "estimatedSeconds": 45,
      "sourceIds": [
        "original-demo"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "summaryZh": "be used to doing 表示习惯于做某事。",
        "ruleZh": "注意 used to do 与 be used to doing 的区别。",
        "evidence": [],
        "distractors": [
          {
            "optionId": "b",
            "reasonZh": "过去常常做某事后接动词原形。"
          },
          {
            "optionId": "c",
            "reasonZh": "被用来做某事通常使用 be used to do。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "习惯于"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "过去常常"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "被用来"
        }
      ],
      "answerOptionId": "a"
    },
    {
      "id": "h1-sentence-predicate",
      "familyId": "h1-predicate",
      "skillIds": [
        "sentence.core"
      ],
      "level": "G0",
      "section": "sentence",
      "reviewMode": "recognition",
      "promptZh": "找出句子的谓语动词：The club meets every Friday.",
      "resourceId": null,
      "estimatedSeconds": 45,
      "sourceIds": [
        "original-demo"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "summaryZh": "meets 是句子的谓语，表示俱乐部每周五见面。",
        "ruleZh": "先找主语，再找主语发出的动作。",
        "evidence": [],
        "distractors": [
          {
            "optionId": "b",
            "reasonZh": "club 是主语，不是谓语。"
          },
          {
            "optionId": "c",
            "reasonZh": "Friday 是时间名词。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "meets"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "club"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "Friday"
        }
      ],
      "answerOptionId": "a"
    },
    {
      "id": "h1-grammar-present",
      "familyId": "h1-present",
      "skillIds": [
        "grammar.tense",
        "grammar.agreement"
      ],
      "level": "G0",
      "section": "grammar",
      "reviewMode": "recall",
      "promptZh": "选择正确的谓语形式：She ___ to school by bus every day.",
      "resourceId": null,
      "estimatedSeconds": 50,
      "sourceIds": [
        "original-demo"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "summaryZh": "主语 She 是第三人称单数，且 every day 表示习惯，用 goes。",
        "ruleZh": "一般现在时中，第三人称单数主语后的动词通常加 s 或 es。",
        "evidence": [],
        "distractors": [
          {
            "optionId": "b",
            "reasonZh": "go 用于 I、you 或复数主语。"
          },
          {
            "optionId": "c",
            "reasonZh": "went 是一般过去时。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "goes"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "go"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "went"
        }
      ],
      "answerOptionId": "a"
    },
    {
      "id": "h2-vocab-participate",
      "familyId": "h2-participate",
      "skillIds": [
        "vocab.collocation"
      ],
      "level": "G1",
      "section": "vocabulary",
      "reviewMode": "transfer",
      "promptZh": "The students took part in the science project. take part in 的意思是：",
      "resourceId": null,
      "estimatedSeconds": 50,
      "sourceIds": [
        "original-demo"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "summaryZh": "take part in 表示参加、参与。",
        "ruleZh": "把短语放回句子，判断学生和项目之间的关系。",
        "evidence": [],
        "distractors": [
          {
            "optionId": "b",
            "reasonZh": "take care of 表示照顾。"
          },
          {
            "optionId": "c",
            "reasonZh": "take place 表示发生。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "参加"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "照顾"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "发生"
        }
      ],
      "answerOptionId": "a"
    },
    {
      "id": "h2-grammar-passive",
      "familyId": "h2-passive",
      "skillIds": [
        "grammar.voice"
      ],
      "level": "G1",
      "section": "grammar",
      "reviewMode": "recall",
      "promptZh": "选择正确形式：The school library ___ by students every afternoon.",
      "resourceId": null,
      "estimatedSeconds": 55,
      "sourceIds": [
        "original-demo"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "summaryZh": "图书馆是被学生使用，且是现在的习惯，使用一般现在时被动语态 is used。",
        "ruleZh": "被动语态的基本结构是 be + 过去分词。",
        "evidence": [],
        "distractors": [
          {
            "optionId": "b",
            "reasonZh": "uses 是主动语态，主语应是使用者。"
          },
          {
            "optionId": "c",
            "reasonZh": "was used 是过去时，不符合 every afternoon 的习惯。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "is used"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "uses"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "was used"
        }
      ],
      "answerOptionId": "a"
    },
    {
      "id": "h2-sentence-although",
      "familyId": "h2-although",
      "skillIds": [
        "sentence.complex"
      ],
      "level": "G1",
      "section": "sentence",
      "reviewMode": "transfer",
      "promptZh": "Although it was raining, the players continued the game. Although 表示：",
      "resourceId": null,
      "estimatedSeconds": 50,
      "sourceIds": [
        "original-demo"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "summaryZh": "下雨是阻碍，但球员仍继续比赛，前后构成让步关系。",
        "ruleZh": "although 引导让步状语从句，常译为虽然、尽管。",
        "evidence": [],
        "distractors": [
          {
            "optionId": "b",
            "reasonZh": "because 表示原因。"
          },
          {
            "optionId": "c",
            "reasonZh": "unless 表示除非。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "虽然、尽管"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "因为"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "除非"
        }
      ],
      "answerOptionId": "a"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3-vocab-contribute",
      "familyId": "h3-contribute",
      "skillIds": [
        "vocab.collocation"
      ],
      "level": "G2",
      "section": "vocabulary",
      "reviewMode": "transfer",
      "promptZh": "Regular reading contributes to better writing. contributes to 的意思是：",
      "resourceId": null,
      "estimatedSeconds": 55,
      "sourceIds": [
        "original-demo"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "summaryZh": "经常阅读有助于更好的写作，contribute to 表示促成、有助于。",
        "ruleZh": "to 在这里是介词，后接名词或动名词。",
        "evidence": [],
        "distractors": [
          {
            "optionId": "b",
            "reasonZh": "depend on 表示依赖。"
          },
          {
            "optionId": "c",
            "reasonZh": "break down 表示出故障或分解。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "有助于、促成"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "依赖于"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "分解、出故障"
        }
      ],
      "answerOptionId": "a"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3-grammar-participle",
      "familyId": "h3-participle",
      "skillIds": [
        "grammar.nonfinite"
      ],
      "level": "G2",
      "section": "grammar",
      "reviewMode": "transfer",
      "promptZh": "Having finished her homework, Lily went for a walk. Having finished 表示：",
      "resourceId": null,
      "estimatedSeconds": 60,
      "sourceIds": [
        "original-demo"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "summaryZh": "Lily 先完成作业，再去散步，Having finished 表示动作先发生。",
        "ruleZh": "完成式分词 having + 过去分词常表示分词动作发生在主句动作之前。",
        "evidence": [],
        "distractors": [
          {
            "optionId": "b",
            "reasonZh": "同时发生通常不需要完成式。"
          },
          {
            "optionId": "c",
            "reasonZh": "被动关系应使用 having been + 过去分词。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "完成作业之后"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "正在完成作业时"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "作业被完成时"
        }
      ],
      "answerOptionId": "a"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3-writing-invite",
      "familyId": "h3-invite",
      "skillIds": [
        "writing.task"
      ],
      "level": "G2",
      "section": "application-writing",
      "reviewMode": "transfer",
      "promptZh": "写邀请信时，哪一句最适合作为开头？",
      "resourceId": null,
      "estimatedSeconds": 60,
      "sourceIds": [
        "original-demo"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "summaryZh": "I am writing to invite you to... 直接说明写信目的，适合邀请信开头。",
        "ruleZh": "应用文开头先交代写信目的，再补充时间、地点和活动信息。",
        "evidence": [],
        "distractors": [
          {
            "optionId": "b",
            "reasonZh": "该句表达感谢，不是邀请信的直接开场。"
          },
          {
            "optionId": "c",
            "reasonZh": "该句表达道歉，不符合邀请目的。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "I am writing to invite you to..."
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "Thank you for your kind help."
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "I am sorry to tell you that..."
        }
      ],
      "answerOptionId": "a"
    }
